(global_label "GND" (shape bidirectional) (at 91.44 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 0.85 0.85)) (justify left)) (uuid 6e59398d-392b-5b35-899e-c22559f563ea))
(text "RGB565 and 8-bit DVP use separate native IO-MUX buses (Espressif hardware guide, tables 11 and 12)." (at 16 165.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 25356360-dda7-525d-8ff6-fc5fb41d1735))
(text "HS OTG is on dedicated pads 44/45. GPIO33/34 are used by RGB after disabling their reset USB-Serial/JTAG function." (at 16 170.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid eecbb47a-b12c-55ea-83b4-e9141713f56f))
(text "GPIO36 is both LCD red MSB and flash-voltage strap. R403 pulls it high for the 3.3 V NOR at reset." (at 16 175.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 968db331-2c84-5034-ac4d-e611df7b1dd9))
(text "GPIO37 and GPIO60 use the existing pulled-up SD select nets. GPIO61 low plus GPIO60 high selects joint download." (at 16 180.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 9e305f1a-792f-55d7-b90e-75765ae3d9f4))
(text "Use I2S0 for two microphone data lines and I2S1 for the full-duplex codec. SPI mode keeps GPIO20..25 at 3.3 V." (at 16 185.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 5d6b2e01-31d9-562c-b7af-1098ed879ddd))
(text "R3A RP2350B pin assignments are preserved. Radio is integrated and the former C6 is removed." (at 16 190.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 82fa448d-00e4-500a-bb32-4ee907b89cf6))
